# IPL Data Analysis Dashboard (2008–2018)

## Project Overview

This project explores data from the Indian Premier League (IPL) from 2008 to 2018 using an interactive dashboard built in Microsoft Excel.

The dashboard provides insights into team performance, match outcomes, toss decisions, venues, title winners and Player of the Match awards across different IPL seasons.

