## Key Performance Insights

The dashboard explores the following areas:

### 1. Matches Won by Team
- Compares the number of matches won by each team.
- Breaks down victories based on whether teams batted or fielded first.

### 2. Toss Decision Analysis
- Examines the relationship between toss decisions and match-winning percentages.
- Compares the outcomes of choosing to bat or field after winning the toss.

### 3. Top 10 Venues
- Identifies the venues that hosted the highest number of matches.
- Shows the distribution of matches based on batting and fielding outcomes.

### 4. Title Winners
- Highlights teams that have won IPL titles across different seasons.

### 5. Top 10 Player of the Match Winners
- Identifies players who have received the highest number of Player of the Match awards.

## Dashboard Features

- Interactive season filters (2008–2018).
- Dynamic charts and visual comparisons.
- KPI cards displaying selected-season information.
- Multiple visualisations for exploring team and player performance.

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- Data Analysis and Visualisation

## What I Learned

Through this project, I strengthened my skills in data analysis and dashboard development. I gained more experience in organising data, creating interactive visualisations, comparing performance metrics and presenting insights in a structured and understandable format.

## Project Goal

The goal of this project is to transform IPL match data into meaningful insights that make it easier to understand team performance, match trends and individual player achievements.

